ness.yaml\npreset selection\n\n.harness/governance.yaml\nrisk + retrieval policy\n\n.harness/skills/*.yaml\nSkill Contracts\n\n.harness/context/capabilities.yaml\nContext vocabulary\n\n.harness/artifacts/skill-outputs.yaml\noutput contracts\n\n.harness/policies/skill-evidence.yaml\nverification Skill → gates\n\n.harness/plugins/\nrules + process\n\n.harness/hooks/\npre-commit / pre-push","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"autoResize":false,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"c2","type":"rectangle","x":430,"y":140,"width":500,"height":760,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1971c2","backgroundColor":"#e7f5ff","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"seed":504,"version":1,"versionNonce":504,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":504,"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},{"id":"t2","type":"text","x":460,"y":170,"width":440,"height":680,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#343a40","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"seed":505,"version":1,"versionNonce":505,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":505,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":20,"fontFamily":5,"text":"EXECUTABLE HARNESS\n\ncheck.ts\nP0 enforcement\n\nclassification.ts\nclassification validation\n\nskill-check.ts / skill-resolve.ts / skill-plan.ts\nP3 contracts + dependency graph\n\ncontext-select.ts\nP2 legacy Context + P3 Skill-aware Context v2\n\nskill-output.ts / skill-evidence.ts\noutput contract + Evidence mapping\n\nevidence.ts / ci-evidence.ts\nP1 local + CI machine trust\n\nself-review.ts / independent-review.ts\nBuilder vs Reviewer boundary\n\ntask-identity.ts / verification-plan.ts\nP2 identity + strategy compatibility\n\ndelivery-gate.ts\nsingle delivery entry\n\nscripts/lib/*\nshared deterministic parsers / validators / freshness","originalText":"EXECUTABLE HARNESS\n\ncheck.ts\nP0 enforcement\n\nclassification.ts\ncl